{"id":"84c35fea1e867240","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-first-order-formula.md","title":"First-Order Formula","display":"df-first-order-formula — First-Order Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-first-order-formula","aliases":["93-df-first-order-formula"],"display":"df-first-order-formula — First-Order Formula","depends_on":["[[93-df-first-order-language]]","[[93-df-first-order-term]]","[[93-df-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-first-order-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-first-order-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-formula — First-Order Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cc9bc888c7dda430\" href=\"?note=cc9bc888c7dda430\" title=\"93-df-first-order-language\">93-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aadc5df21ecc6ba2\" href=\"?note=aadc5df21ecc6ba2\" title=\"93-df-first-order-term\">93-df-first-order-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"11b62d0ad578fa42\" href=\"?note=11b62d0ad578fa42\" title=\"93-df-variable\">93-df-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> and the tags <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathtt{eq},\\mathtt{rel},\\mathtt{neg},\\mathtt{and},\\mathtt{all}\">\\(\\mathtt{eq},\\mathtt{rel},\\mathtt{neg},\\mathtt{and},\\mathtt{all}\\)</span> are pairwise distinct syntax tags outside <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sym}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sym}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Equality is logical; relation applications use symbols in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOSubLang}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOSubLang}_{93}\\)</span> is the sublanguage predicate, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOTm}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOTm}_{93}\\)</span> is the term set, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Voc}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Voc}^{\\mathrm{tm}}_{93}\\)</span> are term supports; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tm}\">\\(\\mathrm{tm}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fo}\">\\(\\mathrm{fo}\\)</span> are mnemonic sort tags.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i\">\\(v_i\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar v_n\">\\(\\bar v_n\\)</span> are the sourced indexed variables and canonical initial tuples of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"11b62d0ad578fa42\" href=\"?note=11b62d0ad578fa42\" title=\"93-df-variable\">93-df-variable</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}\\)</span> is the sourced relation-arity projection; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOFormula}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOFormula}_{93}\\)</span>, free-variable and vocabulary support, derived connectives, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{All}^{n}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{All}^{n}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOSent}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOAt}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{\\langle\\mathtt{eq},t,u\\rangle:t,u\\in\\mathrm{FOTm}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathtt{rel},r,\\bar t\\rangle:r\\in\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land\n\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{FOTm}_{93}(\\mathcal L)^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FOFml}^{0}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\mathrm{FOAt}_{93}(\\mathcal L),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FOFml}^{k+1}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\mathrm{FOFml}^{k}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathtt{neg},\\varphi\\rangle:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}^{k}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathtt{and},\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle:\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}^{k}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathtt{all},x,\\varphi\\rangle:x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}^{k}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}\\mathrm{FOFml}^{k}_{93}(\\mathcal L).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOAt}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{\\langle\\mathtt{eq},t,u\\rangle:t,u\\in\\mathrm{FOTm}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathtt{rel},r,\\bar t\\rangle:r\\in\\operatorname{Rel}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land\n\\bar t\\in\\mathrm{FOTm}_{93}(\\mathcal L)^{\\operatorname{ar}^{\\mathrm r}_{93}(\\mathcal L)(r)}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FOFml}^{0}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\mathrm{FOAt}_{93}(\\mathcal L),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FOFml}^{k+1}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\mathrm{FOFml}^{k}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\n\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathtt{neg},\\varphi\\rangle:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}^{k}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathtt{and},\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle:\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}^{k}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle\\mathtt{all},x,\\varphi\\rangle:x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}^{k}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}\\mathrm{FOFml}^{k}_{93}(\\mathcal L).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOFormula}_{93}(\\varphi;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FOFormula}_{93}(\\varphi;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FOLang}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{FOFml}_{93}(\\mathcal L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\nt\\doteq u&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathtt{eq},t,u\\rangle,&amp;\nr(\\bar t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathtt{rel},r,\\bar t\\rangle,\\\\\n\\neg\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathtt{neg},\\varphi\\rangle,&amp;\n\\varphi\\wedge\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathtt{and},\\varphi,\\psi\\rangle,&amp;\n\\forall x\\,\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\mathtt{all},x,\\varphi\\rangle,\\\\\n\\varphi\\vee\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg\\varphi\\wedge\\neg\\psi),&amp;\n\\varphi\\to\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\varphi\\vee\\psi,&amp;\n\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\wedge(\\psi\\to\\varphi),\\\\\n\\exists x\\,\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\forall x\